{"id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md","title":"Bounded Linear Operator","display":"df-bounded-operator — Bounded Linear Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-bounded-operator","aliases":["58-df-bounded-operator","Bounded Linear Operator","Continuous Linear Operator"],"display":"df-bounded-operator — Bounded Linear Operator","depends_on":["[[58-df-linear-map]]","[[58-df-norm]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-bounded-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-bounded-operator</span><span>Bounded Linear Operator</span><span>Continuous Linear Operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-operator — Bounded Linear Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"58-df-linear-map\">58-df-linear-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2a2b22aeccc3a68f\" href=\"?note=2a2b22aeccc3a68f\" title=\"58-df-norm\">58-df-norm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\">\\(\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,T,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y\\in V\">\\(X,Y,T,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,Y)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|\\cdot\\|_X\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{X}\">\\(\\|\\cdot\\|_X\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{X}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|\\cdot\\|_Y\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{Y}\">\\(\\|\\cdot\\|_Y\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{Y}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Norm}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Norm}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Norm}_S(\\|\\cdot\\|_X,X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Norm}_S(\\|\\cdot\\|_X,X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2a2b22aeccc3a68f\" href=\"?note=2a2b22aeccc3a68f\" title=\"58-df-norm\">58-df-norm</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Norm}_S(\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,Y,\\mathbb F,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Norm}_S(\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,Y,\\mathbb F,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2a2b22aeccc3a68f\" href=\"?note=2a2b22aeccc3a68f\" title=\"58-df-norm\">58-df-norm</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,X,Y,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,X,Y,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"58-df-linear-map\">58-df-linear-map</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\\)</span> (fully explicit predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (existential compatibility alias)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OpNorm}:V^5\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{OpNorm}:V^5\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}operator\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y;\\mathbb F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(T,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Norm}_S(\\|\\cdot\\|_X,X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X)\\land\\mathrm{Norm}_S(\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,Y,\\mathbb F,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,X,Y,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathbb{R}_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\|T(x)\\|_Y\\leq M\\|x\\|_X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}operator\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y;\\mathbb F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(T,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Norm}_S(\\|\\cdot\\|_X,X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X)\\land\\mathrm{Norm}_S(\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,Y,\\mathbb F,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,X,Y,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathbb{R}_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\|T(x)\\|_Y\\leq M\\|x\\|_X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}operator\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(T,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y\\in V\\;\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y;\\mathbb F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}operator\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(T,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y\\in V\\;\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y;\\mathbb F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}operator\\text{-}norm} \\vdash \\operatorname{OpNorm}(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\coloneqq\\sup\\{\\|T(x)\\|_Y:x\\in X\\land\\|x\\|_X\\leq1\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}operator\\text{-}norm} \\vdash \\operatorname{OpNorm}(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\coloneqq\\sup\\{\\|T(x)\\|_Y:x\\in X\\land\\|x\\|_X\\leq1\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A bounded operator is a linear map with a uniform norm bound.</li>\n<li>The operator norm is the supremum over the closed unit ball.</li>\n<li>The function, norm, and linear-map interfaces are recorded with the exact arities used by their source atoms; the existential alias therefore cannot mix incompatible witnesses silently.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Functional Analysis, Chapter 4</li>\n<li>Yosida, Functional Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-linear-map","status":"resolved","